ItemDisplay[MAG !ID ETH (am5 OR ama OR amf) FILTLVL<8]:%NAME%%BLUE%%BORDER-91%%MAP-97%%DOT-1D%%PX-20%// No notification for magic ethereal Maiden Javelin, Ceremonial Javelin, Matriarchal Javelins on filter levels 11-12
ItemDisplay[MAG !ID ETH (am5 OR ama OR amf) FILTLVL~8-11]:%NAME%%BLUE%%BORDER-91%%MAP-97%%DOT-1D%%PX-20%%TIER-0%// Notifies for magic ethereal Maiden Javelin, Ceremonial Javelin, Matriarchal Javelins

// Magic Amazon Bows
ItemDisplay[MAG !ID (am1 OR am6 OR amb) AMAZON (FILTLVL=10 OR FILTLVL=12) !TOWN]:// Hides magic Stag Bows after character level 39
ItemDisplay[MAG !ID (am1 OR am6 OR amb) !AMAZON FILTLVL>7 !TOWN]:// Hides magic Stag Bows after character level 39

// Magic Arrows and Bolts
ItemDisplay[MAG !ID (aqv2 OR aqv3 OR cqv2 OR cqv3) AMAZON FILTLVL>2 !TOWN]:// If character is Amazon, hide magic exceptional and elite arrows and bolts at filter levels 3-12
ItemDisplay[MAG !ID (aqv2 OR aqv3 OR cqv2 OR cqv3) !AMAZON FILTLVL>1 !TOWN]:// If character is not Amazon, hide magic exceptional and elite arrows and bolts on filter levels 2-12
ItemDisplay[MAG !ID (aqv OR cqv) (FILTLVL>1 OR CLVL>19) !TOWN]:// Hide magic normal tier arrows and bolts at character level 20+ or filter levels 2-12

ItemDisplay[MAG !ID (aqv OR aqv2 OR aqv3)]:%BLUE%Arrows//
ItemDisplay[MAG !ID (cqv OR cqv2 OR cqv3)]:%BLUE%Bolts//

